{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DCM_SECTION_7_4_2_6_Service_0x22_ReadDataByIdentifier","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager","page":135,"text":"7.4.2.6 Service 0x22 - ReadDataByIdentifier\n[SWS_Dcm_00253] ⌈The Dcm module shall implement the UDS Service ReadDataByI-\ndentifier (0x22)⌋\n[SWS_Dcm_01335] ⌈On reception of the UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22), if\nthe number of requested DID exceeds the configured maximum number of data identi-\nfiers (refer to configuration parameter DcmDspMaxDidToRead), the Dcm module shall\nsend NRC 0x13 (Incorrect message length or invalid format)⌋\nWith UDS Service 0x22, the tester can request the value of one or more DIDs.\n[SWS_Dcm_01548] Read UDS DID authentication check\nUpstream requirements: RS_Diag_04233\n⌈On reception of the UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22), the Dcm shall check\nif the access to all requested DIDs outside the range 0xF200-0xF8FF is authenticated\nand read the data identifiers only if:\n• for that read DID a role is configured via DcmDspDidReadRoleRef and the ver-\nification according to [SWS_Dcm_01522] was successful or\n• the active white list on that connection has for each requested DID one entry with\nread access that matches that DID.\n⌋\n[SWS_Dcm_01549] Read Dynamically defined DID authentication check\nUpstream requirements: RS_Diag_04233\n⌈On reception of the UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22), the Dcm shall check\nfor all requested DIDs inside the range 0xF200-0xF3FF if the content is based of DIDs\nor parts of DIDs that are authenticated and read the data identifiers only if:\nManager\n• for those read DIDs a role is configured via DcmDspDidReadRoleRef and the\nverification according to [SWS_Dcm_01522] was successful or\n• the active white list on that connection has for each requested DID one entry with\nread access that matches those DIDs.\n⌋\nAccording to [SWS_Dcm_01537] the authentication checks are only executed if\nDcmDspAuthentication is configured. In case of a failed authentication the NRC han-\ndling is according to [SWS_Dcm_01544] and [SWS_Dcm_01551] applies.\n[SWS_Dcm_00438] ⌈On reception of the UDS Service ReadDataByIdentifier (0x22)\n, for…","caption":"7.4.2.6 Service 0x22 - ReadDataByIdentifier","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_DCM_SECTION_7_4_2_6_Service_0x22_ReadDataByIdentifier","releases":["R24-11"],"page":135,"hash":"57def0bd5bef770c","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/cf5aeee78fda/page_135.webp"}],"releases":["R24-11"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/cf5aeee78fda/page_135.webp","trel":"R24-11","tstat":"section","drop":"R25-11","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00253] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00253"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00433] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00433"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00434] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00434"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00435] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00435"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00438] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00438"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00439] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id":"SWS_Dcm_00439"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_Dcm_00440] im Text von SWS_DiagnosticCommunicationManager.","rel":["R24-11"],"id